{"candidateAnswer":"Ambitious, independent, analytical, and reserved.","evidence":"[D26:6 | 1:59 pm on 31 July, 2023] John: It was chaotic when we arrived, but we pulled together. I got a surge of energy and purpose, and we were able to save a family from a burning building. It was wild, but knowing we made a difference made it worth it.\n[D2:14 | 6:10 pm on 22 December, 2022] John: Yeah, they are my rock in tough times and always cheer me on. I'm really thankful for their love. Family time means a lot to me.\n[D3:5 | 8:30 pm on 1 January, 2023] John: We held some events and got to meet some people. We went to a homeless shelter to give out food and supplies. Seeing the smiles on their faces, we knew we made a real difference. We also organized a toy drive for kids in need. It was amazing seeing the community come together to spread some joy.\n[D4:6 | 7:06 pm on 9 January, 2023] John: I tried to stay calm and asked for assistance, which helped me handle the situation and make it back safely.","itemId":"urn:uuid:0d6dce18-6521-59ac-86e0-ea53a02b9f8f","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:3d76c126da0328035decbad37b4f9c39534a3990e519dead4eb1b457a6a556a1","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What attributes describe John?","referenceAnswer":"Selfless, family-oriented, passionate, rational","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"3d76c126da0328035decbad37b4f9c39534a3990e519dead4eb1b457a6a556a1"}}]}